  "hilfen": [9, 6],
  "hasSol": true,
  "task_html": "<div class='task-block task-green'><div class='task-block-label'>Lineare Funktionen im Vergleich</div><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 12px;'>Ein Elternteil &uuml;berlegt, welches Auto langfristig g&uuml;nstiger ist. Die Gesamtkosten (Kauf + Betrieb) lassen sich als lineare Funktion darstellen &ndash; mit x = gefahrene Kilometer.</p><div style='background:#1C1B1F;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:2;margin-bottom:12px;'><strong>Verbrenner:</strong> Anschaffung 5.000 &euro; + 20 ct pro km<br><span style='font-family:monospace;'>f(x) = 0,20 &middot; x + 5000</span><br><strong>E-Auto:</strong> Anschaffung 10.000 &euro; + 10 ct pro km<br><span style='font-family:monospace;'>g(x) = 0,10 &middot; x + 10000</span></div></div><div class='task-block task-green'><div class='task-block-label'>Aufgabe a) &ndash; Wertetabelle erg&auml;nzen</div><div class='tbl-wrap'><table><thead><tr><th style='background:#16a34a;'>Kilometer x</th><th style='background:#16a34a;'>0</th><th style='background:#16a34a;'>20.000</th><th style='background:#16a34a;'>50.000</th><th style='background:#16a34a;'>80.000</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='row-label'>Verbrenner f(x) in &euro;</td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='5000' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='9000' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='15000' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='21000' placeholder='?'></td></tr><tr><td class='row-label'>E-Auto g(x) in &euro;</td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='10000' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='12000' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='15000' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='18000' placeholder='?'></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class='task-block task-green'><div class='task-block-label'>Aufgabe b) &ndash; Schnittpunkt</div><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>Ab wie viel gefahrenen Kilometern ist das E-Auto g&uuml;nstiger? (Schnittpunkt berechnen)</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>Ab&nbsp;x&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='50000' placeholder='?' style='width:90px;text-align:center;'>&nbsp;km</label><div class='check-bar'><button class='btn-check' onclick='checkStation(18)'>&#x2713; &Uuml;berpr&uuml;fen</button><button class='btn-reset' onclick='resetStation(18)'>&#x21BA; Zur&uuml;cksetzen</button><span class='check-result' id='check-result-18'></span></div></div>",
  "sol_html": "<div style='font-size:14px;line-height:2;'><strong>a) Wertetabelle:</strong><br><span style='font-family:monospace;'>f(0)=5.000 &euro; &nbsp;|&nbsp; f(20000)=9.000 &euro; &nbsp;|&nbsp; f(50000)=15.000 &euro; &nbsp;|&nbsp; f(80000)=21.000 &euro;</span><br><span style='font-family:monospace;'>g(0)=10.000 &euro; &nbsp;|&nbsp; g(20000)=12.000 &euro; &nbsp;|&nbsp; g(50000)=15.000 &euro; &nbsp;|&nbsp; g(80000)=18.000 &euro;</span><br><br><strong>b) Schnittpunkt:</strong><br><span style='font-family:monospace;'>0,20x + 5000 = 0,10x + 10000<br>0,10x = 5000 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; x = <strong>50.000 km</strong></span><br>Beide Autos kosten dort genau 15.000 &euro;. Danach ist das E-Auto billiger.</div>"
}
